{"slug":"the-chosen-one-hbmehw","title":"The Chosen One","titleEn":"The Chosen One","type":"series","year":0,"rating":0,"duration":45,"description":"The Chosen One is a fantasy television series developed by Everardo and Leopoldo Gout, and Jorge Dorantes for Netflix. The series is based on the 2004–23 comic book series American Jesus by Mark Millar and Peter Gross, and follows a boy who discovers he has the abilities of Jesus Christ. Unlike the source material, the show takes place in Mexico rather than the United States. The series features an ensemble cast starring Bobby Luhnow, Dianna Agron, Lilith Amelie Siordia Mejia, Juan Fernando González Anguamea, Jorge Javier Arballo, Alejandro Edda, Alberto Pérez-Jácome Kenna, Patricio Serna Meza, Carlos Bardem, Alfonso Dosal, Sofía Sisniega, Eileen Yáñez, and Tenoch Huerta. It released on August 16, 2023.","genres":["فانتزی","درام"],"poster":"/covers/tt1405354/poster.jpg","backdrop":"/covers/tt1405354/backdrop.jpg","posterUrl":"https://images.metahub.space/poster/small/tt1405354/img","backdropUrl":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt1405354/img","videoUrl":"","trailerUrl":null,"director":"","cast":[],"country":"نامشخص","ageRating":"+13","quality":"HD","sources":[],"featured":false,"trendingScore":0,"views":0,"source":"f2m","addedAt":"2026-09-13T23:26:37.795Z","episodes":[{"season":1,"number":1,"name":"قسمت 1","synopsis":"","duration":45,"videoUrl":"https://ymnyrfzzs84wqjrdxmmh85rn.abrtech.top/rD7g/Series/The.Chosen.One/S01/The.Chosen.One.2023.S01E01.1080p.WEB-DL.Farsi.Sub.Film2Media.mkv","sources":[{"q":"480p","v":"زیرنویس چسبیده","url":"https://ymnyrfzzs84wqjrdxmmh85rn.abrtech.top/rD7g/Series/The.Chosen.One/S01/The.Chosen.One.2023.S01E01.480p.WEB-DL.Farsi.Sub.Film2Media.mkv","mb":208},{"q":"720p","v":"زیرنویس چسبیده","url":"https://ymnyrfzzs84wqjrdxmmh85rn.abrtech.top/rD7g/Series/The.Chosen.One/S01/The.Chosen.One.2023.S01E01.720p.WEB-DL.Farsi.Sub.Film2Media.mkv","mb":421},{"q":"1080p","v":"زیرنویس چسبیده","